{"book":"daxue","id":"sishu.daxue.01","index":1,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.01.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"学","pinyin":"xué","traditional":"學","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"亲","pinyin":"qīn","traditional":"親","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mín","traditional":"民","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhǐ","traditional":"止","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàn","traditional":"善","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Adapun Jalan Suci yang dibawakan Ajaran Besar — Da Xue - Thai Hak ini, ialah; menggemilangkan Kebajikan Yang Bercahaya — Mingde (Bing Tik), mengasihi rakyat, dan berhenti pada Puncak Kebaikan.","editorial_annotations":[{"id":"sishu.daxue.01.01.note.qinmin-xinmin","kind":"interpretive_comparison","after_paragraph_index":0,"anchor_hanzi":"親民","title_indonesian":"Perbedaan bacaan 親民 / 新民 — bukan ralat MATAKIN","attribution":"程子 (Chengzi), dikutip dalam 朱熹《四書章句集註》","hanzi":"程子曰：「親，當作新。」","description_indonesian":"Teks utama Ru Classics tetap 親民 (qīn mín), sejalan dengan terjemahan MATAKIN “mengasihi rakyat”. Dalam komentar yang dikutip Zhu Xi, Chengzi mengusulkan 新民 (xīn mín), yakni “memperbarui rakyat”. Terjemahan Inggris James Legge memakai “to renovate the people”, yang mengikuti penafsiran 新民. Ini perbedaan bacaan dan penafsiran, bukan bukti bahwa MATAKIN salah; terjemahan keduanya tetap menurut sumber masing-masing.","reading_variants":{"project_main":{"hanzi":"親民","pinyin":"qīn mín","meaning_indonesian":"mengasihi rakyat","basis":"Teks proyek dan MATAKIN PDF 2011; foto buku MATAKIN cetakan 2012 Bab Utama:1 memperlihatkan 親（亲）民 dengan pinyin qīn mín. Keputusan ini tidak menyetujui keseluruhan pasal sebagai Final."},"comparative":{"hanzi":"新民","pinyin":"xīn mín","meaning_indonesian":"memperbarui rakyat","attribution":"Usulan Chengzi dalam komentar Zhu Xi"}},"source_witness":{"work":"朱熹《四書章句集註》·大學章句","edition":"欽定四庫全書 (WYG)","witness_file":"KR1h0015_000.txt","witness_page":"KR1h0015_WYG_000-7a","source_commit":"84c6b2c5093c57ae5d41c60a73c02323d2420ef0","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR1h0015/blob/84c6b2c5093c57ae5d41c60a73c02323d2420ef0/KR1h0015_000.txt","note":"Saksi WYG mempertahankan 親民 pada teks utama dan mencatat 程子曰親當作新 sebagai komentar, bukan mengganti aksara secara diam-diam."},"edition_caveat":"Foto Hanzi MATAKIN 2012 Bab Utama:1 telah diperiksa dan mengonfirmasi 親民 (qīn mín); catatan pembanding 新民 adalah komentar Chengzi, bukan koreksi otomatis. Status pasal tetap Draft hingga persetujuan tersendiri.","english_alignment_id":"legge-daxue-text-01"}]},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.01.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhǐ","traditional":"止","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dìng","traditional":"定","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"dìng","traditional":"定","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"静","pinyin":"jìng","traditional":"靜","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"静","pinyin":"jìng","traditional":"靜","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ān","traditional":"安","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"ān","traditional":"安","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"虑","pinyin":"lǜ","traditional":"慮","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"虑","pinyin":"lǜ","traditional":"慮","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"得","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Bila sudah diketahui Tempat Hentian, akan diperoleh Ketetapan (Tujuan); setelah diperoleh Ketetapan, baharulah dapat dirasakan Ketenteraman; setelah Tenteram, baharulah dapat dicapai Kesentosaan (Bathin); setelah Sentosa, baharulah dapat Berfikir Benar; dan dengan Berfikir Benar, baharulah orang dapat Berhasil."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.01.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"běn","traditional":"本","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mò","traditional":"末","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"事","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"终","pinyin":"zhōng","traditional":"終","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shǐ","traditional":"始","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xiān","traditional":"先","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jìn","traditional":"近","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Tiap benda itu mempunyai pangkal dan ujung, dan tiap perkara itu mempunyai awal dan akhir. Orang yang mengetahui mana hal yang dahulu dan mana hal yang kemudian, ia sudah dekat dengan Jalan Suci."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.01.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gǔ","traditional":"古","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yù","traditional":"欲","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xiān","traditional":"先","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"治","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"yù","traditional":"欲","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"治","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xiān","traditional":"先","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"齐","pinyin":"qí","traditional":"齊","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiā","traditional":"家","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"yù","traditional":"欲","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"齐","pinyin":"qí","traditional":"齊","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiā","traditi