":"gé","traditional":"格","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Orang jaman dahulu yang hendak menggemilangkan Kebajikan Yang Bercahaya itu pada tiap umat di dunia, ia lebih dahulu berusaha mengatur negerinya; untuk mengatur negerinya, ia lebih dahulu membereskan rumah tangganya; untuk membereskan rumah tangganya, ia lebih dahulu membina dirinya; untuk membina dirinya, ia lebih dahulu meluruskan hatinya; untuk meluruskan hatinya, ia lebih dahulu mengimankan tekadnya; untuk mengimankan tekadnya, ia lebih dahulu mencukupkan pengetahuannya; dan untuk mencukupkan pengetahuannya, ia meneliti hakekat tiap perkara."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.01.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gé","traditional":"格","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"意","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诚","pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"誠","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"意","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诚","pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"誠","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xīn","traditional":"心","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhèng","traditional":"正","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"xīn","traditional":"心","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhèng","traditional":"正","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shēn","traditional":"身","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xiū","traditional":"修","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"shēn","traditional":"身","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xiū","traditional":"修","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiā","traditional":"家","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"齐","pinyin":"qí","traditional":"齊","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"jiā","traditional":"家","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"齐","pinyin":"qí","traditional":"齊","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"治","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"治","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"后","pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"後","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"píng","traditional":"平","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Dengan meneliti hakekat tiap perkara dapat cukuplah pengetahuannya; dengan cukup pengetahuannya akan dapatlah mengimankan tekadnya; dengan tekad yang beriman akan dapatlah meluruskan hatinya; dengan hati yang lurus akan dapatlah membina dirinya; dengan diri yang terbina akan dapatlah membereskan rumah tangganya; dengan rumah tangga yang beres akan dapatlah mengatur negerinya; dan dengan negeri yang teratur akan dapat dicapai damai di dunia."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.01.06","number":6,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zì","traditional":"自","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shù","traditional":"庶","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yī","traditional":"壹","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"是","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiē","traditional":"皆","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xiū","traditional":"修","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shēn","traditional":"身","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"běn","traditional":"本","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Karena itu dari raja sampai rakyat jelata mempunyai satu kewajiban yang sama, yaitu mengutamakan pembinaan diri sebagai pokok."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.01.07","number":7,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"běn","traditional":"本","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"乱","pinyin":"luàn","traditional":"亂","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mò","traditional":"末","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"治","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"fǒu","traditional":"否","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"厚","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bó","traditional":"薄","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bó","traditional":"薄","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"厚","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"未","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Adapun pokok yang kacau itu tidak pernah menghasilkan penyelesaian yang teratur baik, karena hal itu seumpama menipiskan benda yang seharusnya tebal dan menebalkan benda yang seharusnya tipis. Hal ini adalah sesuatu yang belum pernah terjadi."}],"source_file":"01 - Da Xue 大學/01 - Bab Utama.md","title":"Bab Utama"}